    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the real property actions and proceedings law, in relation to\nprohibiting the registration of mortgages in default prior to the filing of a\nnotice of pendency",
    "basePrintNo": "S3933",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3933-2021",
